7,The Boundaries of Jaithmathang Country - Jaithmathang,https://jaithmathang.com.au/the-boundaries-of-jaithmathang-country/,"Alfred William Howitt, The Native Tribes of South-East Australia, 1904 Since its publication in 1904, Alfred Howitt's outline of the Yaitmathang (Jaithmathang) in The Native Tribes of South-East Australia has been highly influential in terms of shaping public understandings of Yaitmathang country.",Jaitmatang,Australian
